  "releaseNotes": "## v1.34.1 (patch)\n\nChanges since v1.34.0:\n\n- fix: port the <compare> generator fix from #191 ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- ci: move the UI suite under tests/ so the exclude actually matches it ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- test: keep the editor's frameless tests off the Linux-only rule ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- ci: name the editor UI suite Schema.Editor.UITests ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Include <compare> in a generated semantic type [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Construct a quantity default the way the vocabulary accepts it [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Take the two SonarCloud findings ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- ci: adopt the consolidated .NET workflow [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))",
